#: library/pluginloader.cpp:95
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"KSim was unable to load the plugin %1 due to the X-KSIM-LIBRARY property "
"being empty in the plugins desktop file"
msgstr ""
"प्लगइन डेस्कटप फाइलमा X-KSIM-LIBRARY विशेषता रित्तो भएकाले केडीई सिमले %1 प्लगइन लोड "
"गर्न अक्षम भयो ।"

#: library/pluginloader.cpp:101
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"KSim was unable to load the plugin %1 due to not being able to find the "
"plugin, check that the plugin is installed and is in your $KDEDIR/lib path"
msgstr ""
"केडीई सिमले प्लगइन फेला पार्न नसकेको कारणले गर्दा %1 प्लगइन लोड गर्न अक्षम भयो, प्लगइन "
"स्थापना गरिएको र तपाईँको $KDEDIR/lib मार्गमा भएकोमा जाँच गर्नुहोस् ।"

#: library/pluginloader.cpp:107
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt>An error occurred while trying \n"
"to load the plugin '%1'. \n"
"This could be caused by the following:<ul>\n"
"<li>The plugin doesn't have the %2 macro</li>\n"
"<li>The plugin has been damaged or has some unresolved symbols</li>\n"
"</ul> \n"
"Last error message that occurred: \n"
"%3</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt> प्लगइन '%1' लोड गर्न प्रयास गर्दा \n"
" त्रुटि देखा पर्यो । \n"
"यो हुनमा निम्न कारणहरू हुन सक्दछ:<ul>\n"
"<li>प्लगइनसँग %2 म्याक्रो नहुनु</li>\n"
"<li>प्लगइन बिग्रेको हुनु वा केही समाधान नभएको प्रतीक हुने</li>\n"
"</ul> \n"
"देखिएको अन्तिम त्रुटि सन्देश: \n"
"%3</qt>"

